{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean Break</strong> is a short first-person narrative game about objects, memory, and the quiet violence of letting go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a seemingly ordinary home. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break furniture that doesn\u2019t belong. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the house begins to change, so does your understanding of what you\u2019re <i>really</i>\u00a0breaking. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal 20 minute journey through grief, memory, and emotional cleanup.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clean Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828850/e57ee887584628fd3145c9a1c6f8fa3fb367ce4a.jpg"},{"name":"Slow Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828850/8e7ebcac0c889cb53bf9a1e137abe85439a4c50e.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828850/087282948274ffeeea34a3983c5a65b84797a218.jpg"},{"name":"Messy Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828850/e7a745d5df0d8e6b3b0e0cdeff2dea57d7cbc3ad.jpg"},{"name":"Repressed Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828850/1f90c1c8c051342e2e2567f9d629e7aae89b93f8.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828850/47e6f0e30ae67b5217feda3a23f1c49cb7a3d4dc.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828850/5b83d6af213f76d1bca57af7d0829bad98f39b43.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap